# Typed gate dependencies of the CE23 lane plan (lane CE-LANEPLAN, wave F1ce).
# Residue: the compiled CE23 graph carries its dependencies only as admitted
# Dependency/Postcondition proposition text (compile_prose manufactures no
# sj:dependsOn edge from a Dependency proposition; HANDWRITTEN.md row). Each
# edge below names the admitted proposition that grounds it (dcterms:source);
# the template refuses an edge whose source is not an admitted proposition
# required by its downstream gate, its upstream gate or the plan root
# (dependency_ungrounded), an endpoint that is not a gate under the root
# (dangling_edge) and a cycle (dependency_cycle).
#
# Grounding propositions (compiled/*/propositions.ttl):
#   P-86e47dafb32e113c Dependency, CE23-11: "The v26.9.23 tag is impossible until
#     CE23-3 through CE23-10 close."
#   P-90fa9bcde22793cd Dependency, root: the critical path "... fresh 13/13
#     STOP=true receipt -> manufacture chatman-ecosystem/release/v26.9.23 ->
#     crosswalk old roles -> root crown/replay -> tag". Encoded: CE23-2 after
#     CE23-1 (crosswalk after manufacture), CE23-9 after CE23-2 (root
#     crown/replay after crosswalk); the tag step is P-86e47dafb32e113c.
#     Not encoded as an edge: "fresh STOP=true -> manufacture". CE23-1
#     pre-stages the subject at the frozen S23 SHAs and CE23-3 (after the fresh
#     STOP, below) imports the crown and rebinds that subject to the main SHAs
#     (DRIVER.md finish sequence: CE1 before the release, CE2 after it), so the
#     bound release subject still follows the fresh STOP.
#   P-8e2088155f51a849 Postcondition, CE23-3: a fresh STOP=true with all 13
#     gate receipts admitted needs GC23-12 closed (CE23-4) and GC23-11 at the
#     post-merge main SHAs (CE23-5).
#   P-9832a6b4845218f9 Postcondition, CE23-8: "The imported Semantic
#     Manufacturing crown proves ..." (the import is CE23-3).
#   P-998f1d40dae58d30 Postcondition, CE23-10: the root receipt binds "all gate
#     receipts" (every crown gate except the tag CE23-11).
#   P-56e51d07af69f595 Postcondition, CE23-7 (implementation class, lp:evidence
#     re-verified at 717d52cd).

